<title>UK: Mobil advises London oil dealers change of phone.</title>
<headline>Mobil advises London oil dealers change of phone.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp's London-based oil trading unit advised European oil dealers on Tuesday that its telephone system was out of action.</p>
<p>Mobil Sales and Supply advised crude and petroleum product traders and brokers to call the alternative number (44) 171 412 4000.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
